sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant Orders
  participant Fulfillment
  participant Payment
  participant Outbox
  Customer->>Orders: POST partial return + idempotency key
  Orders->>Orders: verify owner, lock order/lines, reserve unit slots
  Orders->>Fulfillment: read synthetic delivery state
  Fulfillment-->>Orders: DELIVERED + delivered timestamp
  Orders->>Orders: validate window and immutable per-unit refund allocation
  Orders->>Outbox: OrderReturnRequested v2 in claim transaction
  Orders-->>Customer: 202 returnId/status
  Orders->>Payment: REFUND with stable operation key and amount
  Payment-->>Orders: refund ledger receipt
  Orders->>Outbox: OrderRefundCompleted v2 with receipt transaction
  Note over Orders,Payment: Retry uses identical operation ID and amount; Payment cap remains authoritative
  Note over Orders: Inventory restock waits for Unit 5 inspection
